{"id":"5f5c83c7517a2504","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-double-plus-sheafification.md","title":"Theorem — Double Plus is Sheafification","display":"Theorem — Double Plus is Sheafification","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-double-plus-sheafification","aliases":["14-thm-double-plus-sheafification"],"display":"Theorem — Double Plus is Sheafification","depends_on":["[[14-df-plus-construction]]","[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]","[[14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-double-plus-sheafification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-double-plus-sheafification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Double Plus is Sheafification"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"365bea28fb7d89a0\" href=\"?note=365bea28fb7d89a0\" title=\"14-df-plus-construction\">14-df-plus-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75f5f3e37180e81\" href=\"?note=b75f5f3e37180e81\" title=\"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf\">14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f75a3c8d7a1c91d\" href=\"?note=5f75a3c8d7a1c91d\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow\">14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为预层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^+=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F)\">\\(F^+=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{++}=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F^+)\">\\(F^{++}=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F^+)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_F\">\\(u_F\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"365bea28fb7d89a0\" href=\"?note=365bea28fb7d89a0\" title=\"14-df-plus-construction\">14-df-plus-construction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F^+,\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F^+,\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSheafification}(F^{++},u_{F^+}\\circ u_F,F,\\mathcal C,J).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F^+,\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F^+,\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSheafification}(F^{++},u_{F^+}\\circ u_F,F,\\mathcal C,J).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.5 Lemmas 3–5 及 Theorem 1 的构造，印刷页 131–133；DjVu 第 71–72 图页。局部相等的两类代表在覆盖筛的进一步共同细化上相等，局部性将这些细化汇成覆盖，证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^+\">\\(F^+\\)</span> 分离。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 分离，一族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^+\">\\(F^+\\)</span> 的相容代表可在共同细化上实际相容，再由覆盖局部性汇成一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>-相容族，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^+\">\\(F^+\\)</span> 的粘合；分离性给唯一性。对任意层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\to G\">\\(F\\to G\\)</span>，把各代表的像在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中唯一粘合，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^+\\to G\">\\(F^+\\to G\\)</span>，且不依赖代表；重复一次得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{++}\">\\(F^{++}\\)</span> 的泛性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-plus-construction","status":"resolved","id":"365bea28fb7d89a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-plus-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf","status":"resolved","id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow","status":"resolved","id":"5f75a3c8d7a1c91d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering","status":"resolved","id":"f012515fd4cf0061","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-plus-construction","status":"resolved","id":"365bea28fb7d89a0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 是小站点，$F$ 为预层；$F^+=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F)$、$F^{++}=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F^+)$、$u_F$ 见 [[14-df-plus-construction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F^+=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F)","display":false},{"tex":"F^{++}=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F^+)","display":false},{"tex":"u_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F^+,\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F^+,\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSheafification}(F^{++},u_{F^+}\\circ u_F,F,\\mathcal C,J).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"F^+","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F^+","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F^+","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"F\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"F^+\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"F^{++}","display":false}],"bytes":1592,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification|Theorem — Double Plus is Sheafification]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification]]"},{"id":"5f75a3c8d7a1c91d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书定位：III.5 The Associated Sheaf Functor，印刷页 128–133。对象层化和函子层化分开：本条定义泛箭头；函子在箭头上的作用须由普遍性质唯一诱导，见 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]。存在性由双 plus 构造实现，见 [[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification]]。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification|Theorem — Double Plus is Sheafification]]"},{"id":"cbd8e35070d95035","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["365bea28fb7d89a0","b75f5f3e37180e81","5f75a3c8d7a1c91d","f012515fd4cf0061"]}